{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil Times New Roman;}}\pard\f0\fs20 Arena Champions\par\par A six-map arena rotation: Dustsprint, Embervein, Frostlance, Mirrorwood, Tidemark and DustrunnerCrossing. Rounds last about ten minutes; the first team to 8 kills wins, and the last team standing also wins -- on DustrunnerCrossing, the first team to bank 5 gold nuggets in the enemy chest wins instead. Each map has distinct terrain and a small shared arena object pack. Replays are recordable (Film=1); live spectating via the /observe flag.\par}
